       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LASER-LORA.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LASER-LORA-PROOFS.
           05  WS-OPTICAL-OOK-PULSE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LORA-CHIRP-SPREAD-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ATMOSPHERIC-BEAM-DIVERG  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COGNITIVE-HANDOVER-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCSI-PHYSICAL-MODULATION PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LASER-LORA-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-LASER-LORA-PROVEN    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-LASER-LORA-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-OPTICAL-AND-LORA.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BEAM-AND-HANDOVER.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-SCSI-MODULATION.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-LASER-LORA-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-OPTICAL-AND-LORA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OPTICAL-OOK-PULSE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LORA-CHIRP-SPREAD-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BEAM-AND-HANDOVER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ATMOSPHERIC-BEAM-DIVERG.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COGNITIVE-HANDOVER-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-SCSI-MODULATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCSI-PHYSICAL-MODULATION.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-LASER-LORA-PROOFS.
           IF WS-OPTICAL-OOK-PULSE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LORA-CHIRP-SPREAD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ATMOSPHERIC-BEAM-DIVERG = 1 AND
              WS-COGNITIVE-HANDOVER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SCSI-PHYSICAL-MODULATION = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-LASER-LORA-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-LASER-LORA-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-LASER-LORA-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-LASER-LORA-CODE.
